Hence we map QOS_IN to in_path which is input according to the Bluetooth core specification (Host to controller - or in general input to the Bluetooth sub system from another subsystem on the device.) In other words the central device will need to transmit ISO data.
With this m_sdu change when selecting QOS_IN on the central side you will get a m_sdu of 0 but at the same time request the audio subsystem to generate data to be transmitted by the central - which won't work.
